div>This reminds me of the True Love Gen Tremere that my Mage encountered during he whas a child. First she whas more like the own real sane person in this sea of absurdity later she kept herself locked up because the streets of Vienna are too dangerous for vampires now and my Characters comes by every second or third day and filling bathtube with water and turning it into blood for her.<br /> It whas kind of irony that the century old genie turned into a damsel in distress relying to get fed regulary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}